WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,850
The captain of the city defense army in the lower country is always victorious here.

2
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:04,850
Face me head-on without fear of death

3
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:16,790
I borrowed a set by myself

4
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:18,390
This one next to me is a group

5
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:29,520
Afraid of leaving us alone, don’t go

6
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:41,860
I'm old enough to die

7
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:44,060
Don't let the children sacrifice for us

8
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:46,260
Let's go on our own

9
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:50,050
Can't walk
